rail!. bütün bunlardan sonra kalbleriniz katıldı, size Peygamberler ve onların yedile gönderilen ayat-ü mucizat hiç kâr etmez oldu <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"244\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 243.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 31.6 43.6 59.3 59.3 59.3 68.3 79.6 95.3 95.3 103.6 119.3 119.3 126.0 134.3 141.0 153.7 153.7 166.6 166.6 174.0 180.7 201.0 212.3 212.3 220.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 31.6 43.6 68.3 79.6 103.6 126.0 141.0 180.7 201.0 220.6 227.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> artık o kalbler taş gibi veya ondan daha katıdırlar,<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"155\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 155.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 31.6 38.3 51.0 51.0 63.7 63.7 71.3 87.0 97.6 97.6 113.3 113.3 123.7 123.7 130.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 38.3 87.0 113.3 130.6 138.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> çünkü taşların bazısı vardır ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"192\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 192.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 24.7 31.4 39.7 39.7 46.4 51.0 58.4 74.2 74.2 81.0 81.0 87.7 87.7 94.4 103.4 103.4 111.0 111.0 123.7 130.4 137.2 153.0 159.7 168.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.4 46.4 111.0 123.7 130.4 137.2 159.7 168.7 176.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her halde ondan te'siratı kevniye ve sınaiye ile gürül gürül ırmak